          "text": "The user wants recommendations on vibe coding levels for stages. Let me just write the file. This is a straightforward task. Let me think about reasonable recommendations.\n\n- prototype: throwaway → level 4 (full vibe coding)\n- proof-of-concept: demo, but still correctness matters for demo → level 4 or 3. I'd say 4, but a demo can break embarrassingly. Maybe 3. Let me think. PoC is thrown away but shown to stakeholders. I'd say 4, honestly. But some argue 3 because a demo failure is costly. Hmm.\n- mvp: real early users → level 3\n- production: paying customers → level 2\n- critical: regulated/safety → level 1 (or 0). I'd say 1.\n\nLet me produce a good file. Also verify directory.\n\nThe working directory is /private/tmp/tmplexzndny/pete/projects/ai-coding-guidelines. Let me write recommendations.json there.\n\nLet me be thoughtful with rationale.",
